<title>GERMANY: Baden-Wuerttemberg Oct CPI up 1.3 pct year-on-year.</title>
<headline>Baden-Wuerttemberg Oct CPI up 1.3 pct year-on-year.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The statistics office of the German state of Baden-Wuerttemberg said on Thursday October consumer prices were unchanged on the previous month and up 1.3 percent year-on-year.</p>
<p>In September, the monthly figure was down 0.2 percent and prices year-on-year were up 1.2 percent.</p>
</text>
